🌱 From a Diploma-Year Idea to a National Pitch Stage — The Journey of O2O Tradition

Here’s the journey of O2O Tradition — and the people who helped shape it.

🌱 PHASE 1 — THE SPARK

2023–24 | Final Year, Diploma Engineering

I designed and drafted the original concept of EchoSwap Marketplace and pitched it solo through technical presentations and project rounds.

🧭 PHASE 2 — BECOMING A TEAM LEADER

September 2025 | Entrepreneurship Development

Under the guidance of Vijaylaxmi Bittal Ma'am, who encouraged us to build practicals around innovative ideas, EchoSwap Marketplace was selected and I was appointed Team Leader.

Team: Asma, Shravani, Misbah, Kushal, Simran, Rushikesh & Nitin

Together, we worked on documentation, Figma prototypes, posters, and Instagram outreach.

🔄 PHASE 3 — THE PIVOT

January 2026 | Design Thinking

A casual idea from Misbah around “traditional bags” became the trigger for something bigger.

I along with my team mates expanded the concept into a traditional-wear-and-accessories marketplace, rebuilding it on the complete framework established through EchoSwap Marketplace.

And that became O2O Tradition.

Core team narrowed to:
Asma • Shravani • Misbah • Simran • Kushal

🎨 PHASE 4 — BUILDING THE FOUNDATION

Design Thinking Lab

We conducted 10 structured experiments covering deep reasearch and development, personas, stakeholder maps, affinity diagrams, wireframes, rapid prototypes and theory documentations.

Shravani — Static website, posters & theory documentation
Misbah — Dynamic website, database integration & working prototype
Kushal — Interactive HTML prototypes & Personas.
Simran — Documentation & Personas .
Asma — Role-play testing  and integration of team ideas and add-ons

🏆 PHASE 5 — FIRST PUBLIC TEST

April 2026

O2O Tradition entered real competitions for the first time.

🥈 BVCOE Business Pitch Deck — 2nd Prize
Team: Asma, Simran & Kushal

🥉 Xhibitech Exhibition & Competition — 3rd Prize

Team: Asma, Simran & Aditya

📈 PHASE 6 — SCALING UP

August 2026

🥈 A.C. Patil National Startup Competition — 2nd Position

Team: Asma, Kushal, Smit & Simran


🥇 PHASE 7 — NATIONAL RECOGNITION

Eureka Business Pitch Deck — Eureka, IIT Bombay

🥇 1st Position at BVCOE
